<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Help shape this idea — a quick feedback form</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink: #1B2A22;
    --paper: #F5F0E6;
    --paper-dim: #EBE4D4;
    --gold: #C9971E;
    --gold-soft: #E9C978;
    --fern: #3D6B4F;
    --fern-soft: #DCE8DD;
    --brick: #8C3B2E;
    --brick-soft: #F0DCD5;
    --line: rgba(27,42,34,0.14);
    --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(27,42,34,0.10);
    --shadow-lg: 0 30px 80px rgba(20,30,25,0.20);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;overflow-x:hidden;}
  body{ background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; }
  h1,h2,h3{ font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
  .mono{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; }
  button{ font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer; }
  ::selection{ background:var(--gold-soft); }

  .topbar{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; padding:22px 32px; max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; }
  .topbar-left{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; }
  .brand-name{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:700; font-size:23px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, #2A7DD8, var(--fern));
    -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; color:transparent;
  }
  .brand-tagline{ font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.02em; opacity:.6; margin-top:1px; }
  @media (max-width:480px){
    .topbar{ padding:16px 20px; }
    .brand-tagline{ display:none; }
  }

  /* ---------- WHY IT HELPS (meaningful value explainer) ---------- */
  .why-it-helps{
    background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); border-radius:16px; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:22px;
    display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .why-it-helps .glyph{ font-size:20px; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:1px; }
  .why-it-helps b{ display:block; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:4px; font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:600; font-size:15px; }
  .why-it-helps p{ font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; opacity:.85; margin:0; }

  .founding-tier-box{
    display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; background:var(--gold-soft); border:1px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius:16px; padding:20px 24px; margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .founding-tier-box .glyph{ font-size:20px; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:1px; }
  .founding-tier-box b{ display:block; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:4px; font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:600; color:#5C4108; }
  .founding-tier-box p{ font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; opacity:.9; margin:0; color:#5C4108; }

  /* ---------- OPTION-BASED "why you'll stay" picker ---------- */
  .reason-grid{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:9px; }
  .reason-option{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; border:1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px;
    padding:12px 14px; background:var(--paper); text-align:left; transition:all .15s ease; width:100%;
  }
  .reason-option:hover{ border-color:var(--ink); }
  .reason-option.selected{ border-color:var(--fern); background:var(--fern-soft); }
  .reason-option .r-icon{ font-size:16px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .reason-option .r-text{ font-size:14.5px; font-weight:600; flex:1; }
  .reason-option .r-check{
    width:18px; height:18px; border-radius:5px; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:#fff;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:10px; color:transparent; flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .reason-option.selected .r-check{ background:var(--fern); border-color:var(--fern); color:#fff; }

  /* ---------- RANK-STYLE picker (priorities trade-off) ---------- */
  .reason-option.ranked{ border-color:var(--gold); background:var(--gold-soft,#FFF6DD); }
  .reason-option .r-rank{
    width:22px; height:22px; border-radius:50%; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:#fff;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;
    color:var(--ink); flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .reason-option.ranked .r-rank{ background:var(--gold); border-color:var(--gold); color:#3a2a00; }
  .other-suburb-input.concern-other{ margin-top:8px; }

  /* ---------- WIN-WIN strip ---------- */
  .winwin-strip{
    display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; border-radius:14px; padding:18px 20px;
    background:var(--fern-soft,#EAF3EC); border:1.5px solid var(--fern); margin:0 0 20px;
  }
  .winwin-strip .glyph{ font-size:20px; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:1px; }
  .winwin-strip b{ display:block; font-size:15px; margin-bottom:4px; font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:600; }
  .winwin-strip p{ font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; opacity:.85; margin:0; }


  .wrap{ max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; padding:12px 28px 60px; }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .wrap{ padding:10px 18px 48px; } }
  @media (max-width:480px){
    .invite-strip{ padding:16px 18px; }
    .coming-soon-strip{ padding:16px 18px; }
    .founding-tier-box{ padding:16px 18px; }
  }
  .view{ display:none; }
  .view.active{ display:block; }

  /* ---------- LANDING / ROLE SELECT ---------- */
  .landing-hero{ text-align:center; max-width:640px; margin:26px auto 44px; }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--fern); margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{ content:""; width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--fern); }
  .landing-hero h1{ font-size:36px; line-height:1.15; margin:0 0 14px; }
  .landing-hero h1 em{ font-style:normal; color:var(--brick); }
  .landing-hero p{ font-size:16.5px; opacity:.8; line-height:1.65; margin:0; }

  .role-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:18px; }
  @media (max-width:720px){ .role-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  .role-card{
    background:#fff; border:1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px; padding:28px 24px;
    text-align:left; transition:all .18s ease; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .role-card:hover{ transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:var(--shadow); border-color:var(--ink); }
  .role-card.selected{ border-color:var(--fern); box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--fern-soft); }
  .role-card .role-check{
    position:absolute; top:18px; right:18px; width:24px; height:24px; border-radius:7px;
    border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:var(--paper); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-size:13px; color:transparent; transition:all .15s ease;
  }
  .role-card.selected .role-check{ background:var(--fern); border-color:var(--fern); color:#fff; }
  .role-card .role-icon{
    width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:12px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-size:20px; margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .role-card.customer .role-icon{ background:var(--fern-soft); color:var(--fern); }
  .role-card.business .role-icon{ background:var(--gold-soft); color:#7A5A0E; }
  .role-card h3{ font-size:18px; margin:0 40px 8px 0; }
  .role-card p{ font-size:14.5px; opacity:.72; line-height:1.55; margin:0 0 16px; min-height:58px; }
  .role-card .perk-line{ font-size:12px; font-weight:600; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .role-card .perk-line::before{ content:"✓"; color:var(--fern); font-weight:700; }
  .why-it-helps-perk{ font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; margin-top:8px; color:var(--paper); }
  .why-it-helps-perk::before{ content:"✓"; color:var(--gold-soft); font-weight:700; }

  .role-hint{ text-align:center; font-size:13px; opacity:.6; margin:20px 0 16px; }

  /* ---------- ABOUT / INFO (first page) ---------- */
  .invite-strip{
    display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start; background:#fff; border:1.5px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:16px; padding:20px 22px; margin:8px 0 20px;
  }
  .invite-icon{ font-size:22px; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:1px; }
  .invite-strip b{ display:block; font-size:14.5px; margin-bottom:5px; font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:600; }
  .invite-strip p{ font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.6; opacity:.78; margin:0; }

  .coming-soon-strip{
    background:var(--paper-dim); border-radius:16px; padding:20px 22px; margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .coming-soon-label{ font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; font-weight:700; opacity:.55; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; margin-bottom:12px; }
  .coming-soon-chips{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-bottom:12px; }
  .cs-chip{
    background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:100px; padding:7px 14px;
    font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; opacity:.85;
  }
  .coming-soon-note{ font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; opacity:.7; margin:0; }

  .about-cta-row{ text-align:center; margin:32px auto 0; max-width:340px; }
  .about-cta-hint{ font-size:13.5px; opacity:.62; margin:12px 0 0; }
  .role-continue-row{ max-width:340px; margin:0 auto; }
  .role-continue-row .btn:disabled{ opacity:.35; cursor:not-allowed; }

  /* ---------- FORM SHELL (customer / business / both) ---------- */
  .form-shell{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr; gap:40px; align-items:flex-start; }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .form-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:28px;} .side-panel{ position:static; } }

  .side-panel{ position:sticky; top:20px; }
  .back-link{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; opacity:.6; margin-bottom:20px; background:none; border:none; padding:0; }
  .back-link:hover{ opacity:1; }
  .role-badge{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px;
    letter-spacing:.04em; text-transform:uppercase; padding:7px 14px; border-radius:100px; margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .role-badge.customer{ background:var(--fern-soft); color:var(--fern); }
  .role-badge.business{ background:var(--gold-soft); color:#7A5A0E; }
  .role-badge.both{ background:var(--brick-soft); color:var(--brick); }
  .side-panel h2{ font-size:26px; margin:0 0 12px; }
  .side-panel p.lede{ font-size:14px; opacity:.7; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 26px; }

  .mini-benefit{ display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .mini-benefit .dot{ width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:8px; background:var(--paper-dim); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:12px; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:1px; }
  .mini-benefit b{ font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:2px; }
  .mini-benefit span{ font-size:14px; opacity:.7; line-height:1.55; }

  .form-card{ background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:22px; box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg); overflow:hidden; }
  .progress-track{ height:4px; background:var(--paper-dim); }
  .progress-fill{ height:100%; background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--fern), var(--gold)); transition:width .35s ease; }
  .step-header{ padding:26px 30px 0; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
  .step-count{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; opacity:.5; letter-spacing:.03em; }
  .step-dots{ display:flex; gap:6px; }
  .step-dots span{ width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--paper-dim); }
  .step-dots span.done{ background:var(--fern); }
  .step-dots span.current{ background:var(--gold); }
  .step-body{ padding:18px 30px 30px; }
  .step-body h3{ font-size:20px; margin:0 0 6px; }
  .step-body p.hint{ font-size:14.5px; opacity:.7; margin:0 0 22px; line-height:1.55; }

  .field{ margin-bottom:15px; }
  .field label{ display:block; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:7px; }
  .field .field-sub{ display:block; font-size:11.5px; opacity:.5; margin:-4px 0 10px; }
  .field-sub-inline{ font-weight:400; opacity:.5; font-size:11.5px; }
  .field input, .field select, .field textarea{
    width:100%; padding:11px 13px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; font-size:15px;
    font-family:inherit; background:var(--paper); resize:none;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus, .field textarea:focus{ outline:none; border-color:var(--gold); box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--gold-soft); }
  .row2{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; }
  @media (max-width:480px){ .row2{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  .subsection-label{ font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; opacity:.5; font-weight:700; margin:22px 0 12px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; }
  .subsection-label:first-child{ margin-top:0; }

  .chip-select{ border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:var(--paper); padding:8px 15px; border-radius:100px; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; transition:all .15s ease; }
  .chip-select.selected{ background:var(--ink); border-color:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); }
  .chip-select:hover:not(.selected){ border-color:var(--ink); }
  .chip-row{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:9px; }
  .other-suburb-input{
    width:100%; margin-top:10px; padding:11px 13px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px;
    font-size:13.5px; font-family:inherit; background:var(--paper);
  }
  .other-suburb-input:focus{ outline:none; border-color:var(--gold); box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--gold-soft); }

  .service-cards{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:9px; }
  .service-card{ flex:1 1 calc(50% - 9px); min-width:135px; border:1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius:13px; padding:13px; text-align:left; background:var(--paper); transition:all .15s ease; position:relative; }
  .service-card .icon{ font-size:17px; margin-bottom:6px; display:block; }
  .service-card b{ font-size:14px; display:block; }
  .service-card.selected{ border-color:var(--fern); background:var(--fern-soft); }
  .service-card .check{ position:absolute; top:10px; right:10px; width:16px; height:16px; border-radius:50%; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:9px; color:transparent; }
  .service-card.selected .check{ background:var(--fern); border-color:var(--fern); color:#fff; }

  .star-row{ display:flex; gap:7px; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .star{ width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:11px; border:1.5px solid var(--line); background:var(--paper); font-size:17px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; transition:all .15s ease; }
  .star.active{ background:var(--gold-soft); border-color:var(--gold); }
  .star-caption{ font-size:13.5px; opacity:.62; margin-bottom:20px; min-height:15px; }

  .step-actions{ display:flex; gap:12px; margin-top:6px; }
  .btn{ border:none; padding:12px 22px; border-radius:11px; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); transition:opacity .15s ease, transform .1s ease; }
  .btn:hover{ opacity:.88; }
  .btn:active{ transform:scale(.98); }
  .btn.secondary{ background:transparent; border:1.5px solid var(--line); color:var(--ink); }
  .btn.grow{ flex:1; }
  .btn.full{ width:100%; }
  .error-msg{ font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:var(--brick); margin-top:-6px; margin-bottom:12px; display:none; padding:10px 14px; background:var(--brick-soft); border-radius:8px; }
  .error-msg.show{ display:block; }

  /* ---------- BENEFITS / RETENTION PANEL (on confirmation) ---------- */
  .confirm-top{ padding:40px 34px 10px; text-align:center; }
  .confirm-ring{ margin:0 auto 18px; }
  .confirm-top h2{ font-size:25px; margin:0 0 8px; }
  .confirm-top p{ font-size:15px; opacity:.78; max-width:40ch; margin:0 auto 16px; line-height:1.6; }
  .interest-badge{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:var(--paper-dim); border-radius:100px; padding:8px 16px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12.5px; margin-bottom:6px; }

  .benefits-section{ padding:14px 34px 34px; }
  .benefits-title{ font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; opacity:.5; font-weight:700; text-align:center; margin:18px 0 16px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; }
  .benefit-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .benefit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .benefit-card{ background:var(--paper); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:16px; }
  .benefit-card .tier-icon{ width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px; display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center; font-size:14px; margin-bottom:10px; }
  .benefit-card b{ font-size:15px; display:block; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .benefit-card span{ font-size:13.5px; opacity:.72; line-height:1.5; }

  .restart-row{ text-align:center; padding:0 34px 34px; }

  footer{ text-align:center; padding:30px; font-size:13px; opacity:.5; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-left">
    <span class="brand-name">Testing an idea</span>
    <span class="brand-tagline">Together for a stronger local community</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <!-- ============ VIEW: ABOUT / INFO (first page) ============ -->
  <div class="view active" id="view-about">
    <div class="landing-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">From local, for local</div>
      <h1>Hey neighbour —<br><em>this is early, and your take on it matters.</em></h1>
      <p>This is a simple idea being tested: bringing people nearby together on the services they already need — pest control, cleaning, gardening, handyman work and more — so the price drops the moment enough neighbours join in, and the local businesses doing the work get a fuller, more efficient day instead of scattered one-off jobs. A genuine win for both sides — if it's built right. What matters most right now is one thing: would this actually get used, and what would make it better?</p>
    </div>

    <div class="invite-strip">
      <div class="invite-icon">🙌</div>
      <div>
        <b>The real magic is doing this with people you know.</b>
        <p>A group deal works best when a couple of neighbours or friends join in together — everyone's price drops at once. Once launched, a simple invite link will make that easy to share straight from a phone. For now, it's worth thinking about who'd be worth bringing along.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="coming-soon-strip">
      <div class="coming-soon-label">More categories are on the way</div>
      <div class="coming-soon-chips">
        <span class="cs-chip">⚡ Electrician</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🔧 Plumbing</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🔑 Locksmith</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🏠 Roofing & Gutters</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">❄️ Air Con & Heating</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🐾 Pet Care</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">📚 Tutoring</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">📦 Moving Help</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">💻 Tech Support</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🧺 Appliance Repair</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🧼 Carpet & Upholstery</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">👶 Babysitting & Childcare</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🧓 Elderly & Home Care</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🏋️ Personal Training</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">💇 Beauty & Wellness</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">📷 Photography & Events</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🧾 Tax & Accounting</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">⚖️ Legal Services</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">☀️ Solar & Battery</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🔒 Security Systems</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🧱 Flooring & Tiling</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🚧 Fencing</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🗑️ Skip Bin & Waste Removal</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🌳 Tree & Arborist Services</span>
        <span class="cs-chip">🔩 Mobile Mechanic</span>
      </div>
      <p class="coming-soon-note">Every category added follows the same idea — group up, pay less. If it's a service a household might ever need or want to ask about, it's on the list to consider. Early members get first access and the best group rates as each new one comes online.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-cta-row">
      <button type="button" class="btn full" id="about-continue-btn">Get started</button>
      <p class="about-cta-hint">Takes about a minute — just a few honest questions, no account needed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ VIEW: LANDING / ROLE SELECT ============ -->
  <div class="view" id="view-landing">
    <div class="landing-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Before we launch, tell us how you'd use it</div>
      <h1>How would you like<br>to <em>get involved?</em></h1>
      <p>Whether you're chasing a better price or bringing customers to your business, the loop works better with you in it. Pick what fits — you can always add the other side later.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="winwin-strip">
      <div class="glyph">🤝</div>
      <div>
        <b>Built as a win-win, not a discount gimmick.</b>
